.KEY TEXTFILE/A,EXE,BIGFILE/A
.BRA {
.KET }
.DEF EXE List
; SharedSpeed - timed read/write tests against a mounted SHARED: volume.
; Usage:  Execute SharedSpeed <textfile> [exe] <bigfile>
;   textfile : a ~100 KB text file in SHARED:          (Type'd 5 times)
;   exe      : a CLI program in SHARED:, default List  (run 10 times as "<exe> RAM:")
;   bigfile  : a ~1 MB file in SHARED:                 (copied down, then back up)
; Put the files there first, e.g.  Copy C:List SHARED:   and  Copy S:Startup-Sequence SHARED:
; Resolution is Date's one second, so read the before/after lines and subtract.
; Run once with the 1.8.2 sharedfs in L: and once with 1.8.3, same files.
FailAt 21
Echo "SharedSpeed: SHARED: must be mounted. Files: {TEXTFILE} {EXE} {BIGFILE}"
Echo ""

Echo "--- 1: Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL: x5  (small sequential reads)"
Date
Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL:
Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL:
Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL:
Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL:
Type SHARED:{TEXTFILE} >NIL:
Date
Echo ""

Echo "--- 2: run SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL: x10  (LoadSeg, 4-byte reads)"
Date
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
SHARED:{EXE} RAM: >NIL:
Date
Echo ""

Echo "--- 3: Copy SHARED:{BIGFILE} RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp  (large reads)"
Date
Copy SHARED:{BIGFILE} RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp
Date
List RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp
Echo ""

Echo "--- 4: Copy RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp SHARED:up_{BIGFILE}  (upload, 512-byte blocks)"
Date
Copy RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp SHARED:up_{BIGFILE}
Date
List SHARED:up_{BIGFILE}
Echo ""

Delete RAM:SharedSpeed.tmp QUIET
Echo "Done. Delete SHARED:up_{BIGFILE} from the PC side when finished (no delete over Toolbox)."
